{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1061678/block/singleImage/3256068/df/01M6FJ5TDC23KK21137XHN567M.jpg?updatedAt=1793690520\"/><figcaption>新油麻地避風塘。（Google地圖截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>新油麻地避風塘驚現浮屍。 今日（3日）早上7時46分，新油麻地避風塘對開300米海面有人形物體飄浮，途人發現後連忙報警。警方和救援人員接報後趕至現場，消防派出救援船到場，將該名61歲姓雷男子救起，經檢驗後證實他當場死亡。死者面上有血迹，手臂僵硬呈舉起狀，身穿黑色短袖上衣、藍色長褲及厚底防滑靴，身掛深棕色斜孭袋。警方在死者的隨身黑色袋內檢獲藥物，正在調查其身分及墮海原因。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T07:43:32.936910+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":207,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T02:01:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T19:18:16.776717+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T07:39:08.420407+00:00","content_hash":"37ba032eb3f8acdd369e4ced0758d1dd3bd78a6da87a82abc5390e59376a5bf6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T07:43:32.936910+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}